@startuml
title Sequo API - Notification System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Customer App\nSequo" as CustomerApp
actor "Merchant App" as MerchantApp
actor "SequoHub\nRelay App" as RelayApp
actor "SequoRider\nRider App" as RiderApp
actor "Admin Web" as AdminWeb

rectangle "Sequo API\nSpring Boot" as Api {
  [Domain Services\nOrders, Delivery, Bargaining,\nReturns, Settlement] as Domain
  [Domain Event Publisher] as Publisher
  [Notification Event Listener\nAFTER_COMMIT] as Listener
  [Notification Outbox Worker] as Worker
  [Notification Orchestrator] as Orchestrator
  [Routing Service\nrole + ownership scope] as Routing
  [Preference Policy\nquiet hours + critical override] as Preferences
  [Template Renderer\nlocalized safe payloads] as Templates
  [Device Token Service] as TokenService
  [FCM Push Gateway] as FcmGateway
  [WebSocket Gateway\nSTOMP user queues/topics] as WsGateway
  [SMS Fallback Gateway] as SmsGateway
  [Delivery Audit Service] as AuditService
}

database "PostgreSQL" as Db {
  [device_fcm_tokens] as Tokens
  [notification_preferences] as Prefs
  [notification_outbox] as Outbox
  [notification_messages] as Messages
  [notification_deliveries] as Deliveries
}

cloud "Firebase Cloud Messaging" as FCM
cloud "SMS Provider" as SMS

CustomerApp --> Api : HTTPS registration\nWebSocket /ws
MerchantApp --> Api : HTTPS + /ws
RelayApp --> Api : HTTPS + /ws
RiderApp --> Api : HTTPS + /ws
AdminWeb --> Api : HTTPS + /ws

Domain --> Publisher : publish domain event
Publisher --> Listener : committed event
Listener --> Outbox : enqueue idempotent work
Worker --> Outbox : claim pending work
Worker --> Orchestrator : dispatch
Orchestrator --> Routing : resolve recipients
Routing --> Preferences : channel policy
Preferences --> Templates : render title/body/payload
Templates --> Messages : store in-app message
TokenService --> Tokens : register/revoke/prune
Orchestrator --> FcmGateway : background/locked app push
Orchestrator --> WsGateway : active in-app realtime
Orchestrator --> SmsGateway : critical fallback
FcmGateway --> FCM : send FCM
SmsGateway --> SMS : send SMS
FcmGateway --> AuditService : delivery result
WsGateway --> AuditService : delivery result
SmsGateway --> AuditService : delivery result
AuditService --> Deliveries : attempt audit
Routing --> Prefs : load preferences

note right of Templates
Payloads must contain safe public IDs only.
Never send raw PIN hashes, FCM tokens,
full addresses, phone numbers,
or wallet secrets.
end note

note bottom of SmsGateway
SMS fallback is reserved for
critical PIN, blocked delivery,
relay pickup, and urgent
payment/refund events.
end note

@enduml
